 "product_cap_reading": "Rounds 0..k of a 3-round run are the rounds a k-round run makes, so a cap's result is the best-scoring of them. --refine 1 would publish y12 (promised, 59 pages) at 62 pages instead of 60, failing criterion 5 in the product lane, and costs 1-6 pages on y06, y13, y38, y60, y64; --refine 2 keeps y12 and y21 and costs 1-2 pages on the others. Neither is the default: both regress criterion 8 in the product lane.",
